<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
  <key>Label</key>
  <string>com.jonhill.jon-report</string>
  <!-- Jon, 2026-08-18: "Every 30 minutes you send me the issues closed on
       telegram. Not excuses." and "And also send me a phase report at that
       time as well. That way i can see progress."

       Both in ONE job so the two messages always arrive together and cannot
       drift apart into two schedules that disagree about what time it is.
       1800s = the 30 minutes he asked for, exactly.

       Neither script invokes a model. Neither reports effort, blockers, or
       reasons -- closed-report names issues that closed, phase-report names
       the size of the pile. That constraint is the specification.

       Points at the shared checkout, not a worktree: per CLAUDE.md, that is
       where the Director actually runs scripts/supervisor from, and a
       worktree is temporary. Install with:
         cp scripts/supervisor/com.jonhill.jon-report.plist \
           ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.jonhill.jon-report.plist
         launchctl load ~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.jonhill.jon-report.plist -->
  <key>ProgramArguments</key>
  <array>
    <string>/bin/bash</string>
    <string>-c</string>
    <string>/bin/bash /Users/jon/source/repos/Personal/agent-supervisor/scripts/supervisor/closed-report.sh; /bin/bash /Users/jon/source/repos/Personal/agent-supervisor/scripts/supervisor/phase-report.sh</string>
  </array>
  <key>StartInterval</key>
  <integer>1800</integer>
  <key>RunAtLoad</key>
  <false/>
  <key>ProcessType</key>
  <string>Background</string>
  <key>EnvironmentVariables</key>
  <dict>
    <key>PATH</key>
    <string>/opt/homebrew/bin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/bin:/bin:/Users/jon/.local/bin</string>
    <key>HOME</key>
    <string>/Users/jon</string>
    <key>USER</key>
    <string>jon</string>
  </dict>
  <key>StandardOutPath</key>
  <string>/Users/jon/.local/state/agent-dotfiles-supervisor/jon-report.log</string>
  <key>StandardErrorPath</key>
  <string>/Users/jon/.local/state/agent-dotfiles-supervisor/jon-report.log</string>
</dict>
</plist>
